Code <a href="#S2.F2" title="Figure 2 ‣ 2.5.1 GPT-2 fork-join parallelisation ‣ 2.5 GPT-2 pre-training ‣ 2 Background ‣ A Task-based Data-flow Methodology for Programming Heterogeneous Systems with Multiple Accelerator APIs©2026. This manuscript version is made available under the CC BY-NC-ND 4.0 license https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-nd/4.0/" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">2</span></a> parallelized with OmpSs-2
